1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,540
(Howard:)Mostly with Asian
and Jewish astronauts.

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,660
(Penny:)All right. Pass the soy sauce.
Coming up.

3
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,940
(Leonard:)So how's work?

4
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:20,390
(Penny:)Oh, it's not bad.

5
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:21,940
(Penny:)Kind of hungry.

6
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:23,780
(Leonard:)Yeah, we all are.

7
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,580
(Howard:)Just wait.

8
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,330
(Sheldon:)You realize, Penny,
that the technology

9
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:29,480
(Sheldon:)that went into this arm
will one day make

10
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:32,900
(Sheldon:)unskilled food servers
such as yourself obsolete.

11
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:34,340
(Penny:)Really?

12
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:36,970
(Penny:)They're going to make a robot
that spits on your hamburger?

13
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:40,120
(Sheldon:)I thought you
broke up with her.

14
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:41,880
(Sheldon:)Why is she here?

15
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:44,110
(Howard:)Okay, here we go.

16
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:46,600
(Howard:)Passing the soy sauce.

17
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,270
(Howard:)Put out your hand.

18
00:00:52,770 --> 00:00:54,310
Oh!

19
00:00:55,690 --> 00:00:56,820
(Penny:)That's amazing.

20
00:00:56,830 --> 00:00:58,260
(Sheldon:)I wouldn't say amazing.

21
00:00:58,260 --> 00:01:00,260
(Sheldon:)At best,
it's a modest leap forward

22
00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:01,810
(Sheldon:)from the basic technology

23
00:01:01,810 --> 00:01:04,650
(Sheldon:)that gave us
Country Bear Jamboree.

24
00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:06,950
(Howard:)Hey, Sheldon?

25
00:01:06,950 --> 00:01:08,870
(Sheldon:)Yes?

26
00:01:14,990 --> 00:01:16,960
(Sheldon:)Peace?

27
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:18,550
(Howard:)No, not peace.

28
00:01:18,550 --> 00:01:19,910
(Howard:)Hang on.

